OL,3,GNEWSAFour men in court over suspected
OL,4,Aprostitution operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour men have appeared in Belfast Crown
OL,7,FCourt charged with a number of offences
OL,8,Fincluding rape, human trafficking,
OL,9,Fcontrolling prostitution for gain and
OL,10,Fdrugs offences.
OL,12,FOliver James MacCormack, who is 73,
OL,13,Fwith an address of Maghaberry Prison,
OL,14,Fis charged with 30 charges including
OL,15,Frape, administering a substance with
OL,16,Fsexual intent, human trafficking,
OL,17,Fsupplying a class A drug and
OL,18,Fcontrolling prostitution.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
