OL,3,GNEWSAFour men in court over suspected
OL,4,Aprostitution operation
OL,5,
OL,6,FRobert Rogers, aged 81, from Antrim
OL,7,FRoad, Belfast, is charged with eight
OL,8,Fcharges including human trafficking,
OL,9,Fcontrolling prostitution and sexual
OL,10,Fassault.
OL,12,FThe men pleaded not guilty to all
OL,13,Fcharges.
